  "description": "Conversion of 4 Digswell Street involving formation of new glazed roof lantern, to create a self-contained Class B1 business unit in the ground floor and a 1-bedroom maisonette unit in the combined 1st floor and roof-space. Redevelopment of 2 Digswell Street to create a three-storey building containing a self-contained Class B1 business unit in the ground floor and two 1-bedroom flats. Redevelopment of remainder of site to create a four-storey building with set-in, penthouse-style top floor on the Furlong Road frontage, containing two 2-bedroom maisonettes and two 3-bedroom maisonettes, and an open courtyard behind a retained three-storey wall between the Furlong Road and Digswell Street buildings.",
